5,1,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. It is a pleasure to meet you all. I hope we can work together harmoniously to choose a program that truly benefits our patients and supports our staff. I look forward to our discussion.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a pleasure to be here with you. I believe a gentle and thoughtful approach will lead us to the right decision. I look forward to our collaboration.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Misaki,,Hello. I agree. Let's keep our discussion focused and objective to ensure we make the most practical choice for the hospital.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. I trust we can avoid the usual pitfalls of optimism and instead approach this selection with a cold, logical eye for what is actually sustainable.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,Hello everyone. It is such a joy to be here with you all. Let us be kind to one another as we seek a path that brings comfort to our patients and peace to our hardworking staff.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,I believe it is important to understand why some of our previous initiatives have struggled over time. I would like to look into the board minutes on a jointly run clinic and the data agreements with outside surgeries.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree that looking back is wise. To understand the actual impact of our past efforts, I shall examine the readmission figures during the call-back trial and the visit completion on the shared nursing round.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I believe we need to understand the current pressure on our teams. I will look into the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, as well as the therapy and midwifery staffing review.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,I shall examine this year's development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs by contact location. It is far too easy to ignore the actual costs of maintenance in favor of a shiny new start.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I think it would be very helpful to see how our space is holding up. I shall look into the rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, and what the booking system records. We must ensure we have room for everyone.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I think we have a very balanced approach. By looking at both the administrative agreements and the physical capacity, we can ensure the program we choose is truly sustainable. I am happy with our choices.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. By blending the lessons of the past with the realities of our current resources, we can find a path that is both meaningful and sustainable. I am content to proceed.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. We have covered the financial, spatial, and operational aspects. I believe this comprehensive view will prevent us from overlooking any critical staffing risks. I am ready to proceed.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,The distribution of research is sufficient. I have no interest in altering my choices; the financial data will speak for itself. I am ready to see if the reality matches the ambition.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,It is wonderful to see us all in such agreement. I feel very comforted knowing we are looking after so many different needs. I am ready to see what we discover together.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. Let us move forward with a spirit of cooperation. I look forward to hearing what each of you discovers in the records.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I agree. May the information we find bring us clarity and guide us toward a choice that truly serves the patients. I am ready.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Let's see what the data reveals. I'm ready to proceed.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Shion,,I have no further comments. Let us see if the numbers are as cooperative as our conversation has been. I am ready.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I am also ready. I shall wait with a warm heart to see what the records tell us. I wish you all a very productive search.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
